# AC4 证据：CI 配置中该测试失败会阻断合并
# （1）工作流全文与关键行计数；（2）本地按 CI 同样的事件序列复跑，证明退出码会变成非 0

===== 1) .github/workflows/leak-scan.yml 全文 =====
name: leak-scan

on:
  pull_request:
    branches: [main]
  push:
    branches: [main]

permissions:
  contents: read

jobs:
  leak-scan:
    name: leak-scan
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    timeout-minutes: 5
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Set up Python
        uses: actions/setup-python@v5
        with:
          python-version: "3.11"

      - name: Install dependencies
        run: |
          python -m pip install --upgrade pip
          pip install -r requirements.txt

      - name: Enumerate routes and compare with registry
        run: python -m scripts.check_registry

      - name: Contact leak scan (pytest)
        run: python -m pytest tests/ -q

      - name: Upload report and logs
        if: always()
        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
        with:
          name: leak-scan-report
          path: |
            reports/report.md
            docs/checks/

===== 2) 关键断言 =====
pull_request_trigger=True
pytest_step_count=1
continue_on_error_count=0
exit_code_swallow_count=0

===== 3) 模拟 CI 步骤：注入一条泄露后跑同一命令，退出码必须非 0 =====
check_registry_exit=0
FAILED tests/test_api_surface.py::test_endpoint_has_no_contact_leak[GET-/api/mini/support/tickets-member]
FAILED tests/test_api_surface.py::test_endpoint_has_no_contact_leak[GET-/api/mini/support/tickets-staff]
FAILED tests/test_report_shape.py::test_no_leak_rows_in_baseline - AssertionE...
5 failed, 179 passed in 3.14s
pytest_exit=1
=> step 失败 -> job leak-scan 失败 -> PR 必过检查不满足，合并按钮禁用

===== 4) 恢复基线后同样命令，退出码必须为 0 =====
check_registry_exit=0
184 passed in 2.69s
pytest_exit=0
